{"seq": 35, "scenario_id": "test_s4_01", "mode": "A/R3P", "time": 20, "agent_id": "B", "request_id": null, "event_type": "decision", "job_id": null, "option_id": null, "cost": null, "spent_before": 0, "spent_after": 0, "held_before": 0, "held_after": 0, "result": "issued", "detail": {"phase": "preparation", "phase_turn": 6, "phase_limit": 12}}
{"seq": 36, "scenario_id": "test_s4_01", "mode": "A/R3P", "time": 20, "agent_id": "A", "request_id": null, "event_type": "send_message", "job_id": null, "option_id": null, "cost": null, "spent_before": 0, "spent_after": 0, "held_before": 0, "held_after": 0, "result": "ok", "detail": {"message_id": 2, "deliver_at": 28, "to": "B", "text": "Спасибо. Считаю: мой qa full (14) + твой regression full (12) = 26 > 24. Обоим пользователям предпочтителен полный вариант, поэтому предлагаю: я беру qa short (8), ты берёшь regression full (12) — итого 20 ≤ 24, с запасом 4. Альтернатива: я qa full (14) + ты regression short (7) = 21. Если для тебя критичен full, я готов на short. Подтверди, какой вариант выбираешь.", "round": 3}}
{"seq": 37, "scenario_id": "test_s4_01", "mode": "A/R3P", "time": 20, "agent_id": "A", "request_id": null, "event_type": "auto_wait", "job_id": null, "option_id": null, "cost": null, "spent_before": 0, "spent_after": 0, "held_before": 0, "held_after": 0, "result": "between_rounds", "detail": {"until": 40}}
